notes: This began in group meeting. Someone would put up a deck, and my advisor — and honestly most of the room — could tell almost immediately that a model had made it. The design was often fine. Sometimes it was better than fine. The tell was that nobody seemed to have chosen anything. I started watching for that feeling instead of for a particular template.
